#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup.rst:7
#: de4bbdc5a9b04f3d93072d78592c537b
msgid ""
"Aerobatic operation is possible in ACRO mode. However, the normal "
"collective pitch setup of -2° to +12° will not allow inverted maneuvers. "
"If desired, the :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>` and :ref:`H_COL_MIN "
"<H_COL_MIN>` values cam be setup for -10°or 12° to +10° or +12°. Hover "
"upright will now be between center and high stick and inverted hover "
"between center and low stick."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup.rst:9
#: e6be60aa58914ea89c86be8991b1b8b1
